editor_description = "Expanded Library expansion content (2026 expansion). Built by tools/expanded/expansion/build_expansion.gd from expansion_layout.gd (x6): the basement / service network (zone G), the electrical room (zone D), the west and east service stairs. New puzzles, mechanics and areas go here, not into expanded_library.tscn, whose builder is frozen. Instanced once into expanded_library.tscn as \"Expansion\", right after \"Gameplay\"; content uses the level's existing systems through their groups."
